{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-common-biology-35","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"biology","number":35,"points":null,"unitId":"bio-methods","unitLabel":"생명과학 실험·분석","topic":"원심분리·방사성동위원소","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["bio-methods","micro","gene"],"stem":"3H]dT(데옥시티미딘)은세포내DNA를방사성동위원소로\n35. [\n3H]dT를이용하여다음두가지\n표지하는데사용하는화합물이다. [\n실험을하였다.\n<실험A>\n대장균을[3H]dT가함유된배지에서30초간배양한후,\n즉시균체를모아DNA를분리하였다. 이DNA를단일가닥\n상태로초원심분리하여질량에따라분리하였다. 원심분리관의\n위에서부터일정량씩분획을받은후각분획의방사능을\n측정하였다(답지의실선).\n<실험B>\n3H]dT가함유된배지에서30초간배양한후균체\n대장균을[\n3H]dT가함유되지않은배지에서다시2분간\n를모아씻고, [\n배양하였다. 다시균체를모아DNA를분리하고이DNA를\n<실험A>와동일한방법으로초원심분리한후방사능을측정\n하였다(답지의점선).\n위실험에서얻어진결과를나타낼수있는유형으로가장적당한\n것은?","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":2,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]},{"number":3,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t024"]},{"number":4,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":5,"text":"","assetIds":["fig-04"],"textItemIds":["t026"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":772,"height":583,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,63.188,308.8,233.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-35/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":672,"height":210,"region":0,"bbox":[38.456,352.388,268.8,84.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t023"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-35/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":672,"height":211,"region":0,"bbox":[38.456,448.788,268.8,84.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t025"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-35/03.webp"},{"id